<Placemark><name>Lot 4 Psu-143364 — OCT P-1616 (v7)</name><styleUrl>#v7</styleUrl>
<description>Lot 4, Psu-143364 — OCT P-1616 (Allan V. Inocalla), 152,069 sqm. POSITION v7 (2026-09-21): corner 1 = official BLBM No. 1 Bo. Batobalane monument (DENR CN tie-point table id 52589, datum proven Luzon/PRS92 by 0.00 m PTM round-trip, PRS92-to-WGS84 EPSG acc 0.05 m) + tie line N.60°01'W 3,508.83 m. MINUTES DIGIT RESOLVED = 01': the 2012 Senen V. Inocalla small-scale-mining sketch plan (same monument, tie N.57°49'W 3,579.00 m; boundary closure 0.09 m, area 133,700 vs stated 133,690 sqm) interlocks with Lot 4 at 0.1-0.2 m ONLY at 01' (31' leaves a 23 m gap, 51' 39 m). Two independent surveys mutually confirm. Est. accuracy ±20-30 m absolute (datum transform + table fidelity); relative geometry decimeter-grade. Closure 0.07 m, area 152,068.9 sqm. PENDING VERIFICATION: physical mojon GPS pin.</description>
<Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>122.711924,14.249210,0 122.712017,14.250592,0 122.712577,14.248476,0 122.714503,14.247727,0 122.712449,14.245912,0 122.710968,14.246198,0 122.709553,14.245439,0 122.709333,14.247186,0 122.708962,14.247894,0 122.708599,14.247975,0 122.708093,14.247815,0 122.708028,14.248495,0 122.709930,14.248490,0 122.710740,14.249009,0 122.711930,14.248575,0 122.711924,14.249210,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Senen V. Inocalla parcel (2012 mining-permit plan)</name><styleUrl>#sen</styleUrl>
<description>Senen Villafria Inocalla parcel — Sketch Plan of Small Scale Mining Permit Application & Topographic Survey (Jan 27, 2012, GE Jose Mari P. Ayton), Brgy. Capacuan, Paracale, 133,690 sqm (computed 133,700, closure 0.09 m; boundary course 11-12 corrected to S64°48'W from scan misread S84°48'W). Tie N.57°49'W 3,579.00 m from BLLM/BLBM No. 1 Batobalane. Adjoins Lot 4 Psu-143364 (shared boundary confirmed 0.1-0.2 m), Lot 1 Psu-143364, Merquiades Lamadrid (N), public land (S), creek (E). Topo survey area 42,972 sqm within. MINERAL-PROOF EXHIBIT: family small-scale mining permit application on land adjoining Lot 4.</description>
